--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data and models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

CMU DSL-StrongPasswordData
  Killourhy, K.S. and Maxion, R.A. "Comparing Anomaly-Detection Algorithms
  for Keystroke Dynamics." DSN 2009, pp. 125-134.
  The dataset is NOT redistributed here — `data/` is gitignored and a CI
  guard rejects any commit that adds it. Identity results in
  evaluation/results.json are computed against a locally obtained copy.

CICIDS2017
  Sharafaldin, I., Lashkari, A.H. and Ghorbani, A.A. "Toward Generating a
  New Intrusion Detection Dataset and Intrusion Traffic Characterization."
  ICISSP 2018.
  The committed artifacts models/network/cicids2017_scaler.pkl and
  models/network/cicids2017_xgboost_model.pkl are weights derived from this
  dataset, which the University of New Brunswick Canadian Institute for
  Cybersecurity requires be cited on use. These artifacts are not on the
  live proxy path (see docs/LIMITATIONS.md).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

mitmproxy, FastAPI, Mangum, pydantic, uvicorn, boto3, python-jose, passlib
and bcrypt are installed as dependencies, not vendored. Their licenses
apply to their own distributions.

Chart.js 4.4.1 is referenced from a CDN in console/index.html; no Chart.js
source is included in this repository.
